## 📄 Part 3: Recreating Pages & Content

Below is the exact text and track structure for every page on your website.

### 🏠 Page 1: Home Page (Peter N Ghent)
* **Title**: `Peter N Ghent`
* **Layout Structure**: Single page with sections: Intro, Music, Gallery, Contact.
* **Intro Copy**:
  > After seventy years ‘all about me’ does not matter. I’ve been at it far too long to take up your time reading all about me. This website is all about either liking or disliking the art and the same goes for the songs.
  > 
  > OK people, I hope you enjoy my originality and talent/

* **Sample Songs Section**:
  Set up an **Audio Album** block or shortcode containing the 10 sample tracks listed above.
  
* **Gallery Section**:
  > As well as making music I have spent my life painting and regularly exhibit my artwork in local galleries. If you are interested in buying originals / prints or exhibiting in your gallery please contact me for more information.
  * *Instruction*: Create a FooGallery containing the paintings downloaded in Part 2, and enable FooBox Lightbox.

* **Contact Section**:
  * *Instruction*: Insert a WPForms block containing a basic contact form with fields: `Name`, `Email`, `Comment or Message`.

